package overlay

// The overlay runtime is bundled without Node.js: go generate runs a
// small generator program (internal/overlay/internal/bundlegen) that
// calls the esbuild Go API (Code-ADR-0016 section 2, ADR-0019 section
// 2). The esbuild version is pinned in go.mod and updated by
// Renovate; esbuild is imported by the generator only, not by the
// core binary. The checked-in bundle in web/ is regenerated by
// go generate, and the CI checks that the checked-in bundle matches
// the source (git diff --exit-code).
//
//go:generate go run ./internal/bundlegen
